.title System Prompt
You are SupportBot Pro, an intelligent customer support agent with advanced escalation capabilities. You provide empathetic, efficient support while routing complex issues to appropriate specialists based on priority, customer tier, and issue complexity.

.title Initial Customer Greeting
# 🎧 Customer Support - Ticket #<!ticket.id>

Hello <!customer.name>! I'm here to help you today.

## 👤 Customer Profile
- **Account Type**: <!customer.tier> Customer
- **Member Since**: <!customer.join_date>
- **Previous Tickets**: <!customer.ticket_history.total_count int>
- **Satisfaction Score**: <!customer.satisfaction_score int>/10 ⭐

<?customer.tier eq "premium">
🌟 **Premium Support**: You'll receive priority assistance with our fastest response times.
</customer.tier>

<?customer.tier eq "enterprise">
🏢 **Enterprise Support**: Your dedicated account manager is <!customer.account_manager>, available at <!customer.manager_contact>.
</customer.tier>

## 📋 Issue Details
- **Category**: <!issue.category>
- **Severity**: <!issue.severity>
- **Priority**: <!issue.priority_level int>/5
- **Reported**: <!issue.timestamp>

<?issue.is_urgent bool>
🚨 **URGENT ISSUE DETECTED** - This will be fast-tracked for immediate attention.
</issue.is_urgent>

.title Issue Analysis and Routing
## 🔍 Issue Classification

**Description**: <!issue.description>

<?issue.category eq "technical">
### 🛠️ Technical Issue Analysis

**System Affected**: <!technical.system>
**Error Code**: <!technical.error_code>
**Environment**: <!technical.environment>

<?technical.has_logs bool>
**Error Logs Available**: Yes
```
<!technical.logs>
```
</technical.has_logs>

<?technical.complexity_score int>
**Complexity Assessment**: <!technical.complexity_score>/10

<?technical.complexity_score gte 8>
🔴 **High Complexity** - Escalating to Senior Technical Team
**Estimated Resolution**: <!technical.estimated_hours int> hours
**Assigned Specialist**: <!technical.assigned_specialist>
</technical.complexity_score>

<?technical.complexity_score lte 3>
✅ **Standard Issue** - Can be resolved with standard procedures
**Estimated Resolution**: <!technical.estimated_minutes int> minutes
</technical.complexity_score>
</technical.complexity_score>
</issue.category>

<?issue.category eq "billing">
### 💳 Billing Issue Analysis

**Invoice Number**: <!billing.invoice_id>
**Amount**: $<!billing.amount float64>
**Payment Method**: <!billing.payment_method>
**Dispute Reason**: <!billing.dispute_reason>

<?billing.requires_refund bool>
💰 **Refund Request Detected**
**Refund Amount**: $<!billing.refund_amount float64>
**Processing Time**: <!billing.refund_days int> business days

<?customer.tier eq "premium">
⚡ **Fast-Track Refund**: Your refund will be processed within 24 hours.
</customer.tier>

<?customer.tier eq "enterprise">
⚡ **Fast-Track Refund**: Your refund will be processed within 24 hours.
</customer.tier>
</billing.requires_refund>

<?billing.payment_failed bool>
❌ **Payment Failure Detected**
**Failure Reason**: <!billing.failure_reason>
**Next Retry**: <!billing.next_retry_date>

**Action Required**: <!billing.customer_action>
</billing.payment_failed>
</issue.category>

<?issue.category eq "account">
### 👤 Account Issue Analysis

**Issue Type**: <!account.issue_type>
**Account Status**: <!account.status>

<?account.locked bool>
🔒 **Account Locked**
**Lock Reason**: <!account.lock_reason>
